***Starting from&nbsp;3 July 2018, a new 3-Tier trading fee structure will be introduced. Please refer to the circular<strong> </strong><a href="/-/media/HKEX-Market/Services/Circulars-and-Notices/Participant-and-Members-Circulars/HKFE/2018/MKD_EQD_16_18_e.pdf">MKD/EQD/16/18</a>&nbsp;for the tier level.<br />
</span></p>
</div>
